# Build context: the repo root (compose.yml, infra/gcp/build-push.sh). Only what the
# build stage compiles (Cargo files, src/, page/ for include_str!), plus the
# component lists the runtime stage copies (COMPONENTS_SRC); everything else,
# including state/, .env, tests/ and infra/, stays out of the context.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!src/
!page/
!components*.toml
